 "name": "edge_bevel_open_fan_cap",
 "description": "Edge Bevel with a PARTIAL spoke selection at a hub that sits on an OPEN (boundary) fan, at Round Level 1 and 0. The reference builds the cap; it does not decline the shape. With the selected spokes interior it builds the SAME cap as the closed fan, vertex for vertex.",
