 "our_divergence": "vibe3d REFUSES this shape outright before any mutation (an open fan with a ring of three or more corners returns 0). That refusal was registered as the safe, asserted behaviour on the grounds that no reference dump existed. One does now, and the reference does not refuse -- so the refusal is a DIVERGENCE, not a simplification, and this fixture is target geometry rather than a regression lock.",
